Third-party data
----------------

assets/words/english_200.txt and assets/words/english_1k.txt are selections
from the Wiktionary frequency list of Project Gutenberg texts
(https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Wiktionary:Frequency_lists/PG/2006/04/1-10000),
kept in its order with single letters, names, archaic words, contractions and
numbers left out. Wiktionary content is available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

assets/quotes/english.txt contains short, widely circulated quotations
attributed to well-known people, collected for this project.
